<!--
  Audio Cat mark: two eyes and a mouth. Three shapes of ink.

  No ears, no nose, no muzzle - the mouth is the whole expression, and at 48dp
  anything more turns to noise. The point faces down: an upward caret reads as a
  frown. Everything sits inside the 66dp safe circle that launchers crop to.
-->
